What this licence covers

The MIT licence above covers the code of this repository: the build and the
validator (_system/build_kb.py, _system/kits.py and their helpers), the query
tool (_system/kb_query.py), the PDF and web edition builders, the test, eval and
tool scripts, the templates, the web edition's JavaScript and CSS, the .bat
scripts at the top level, and the documentation of the code under _system/.

It does not cover:

- _system/ocean_art.py and everything under _system/brand/ (the art code and
  the artwork, including the Diver bot): CC BY-NC-ND 4.0.
- The content (claims, topics, sessions, maps, the web edition's text, the
  field guide PDFs, the agent pack, METHOD.md): CC BY-NC 4.0, except the
  developer kit and the glossary, which are CC BY 4.0. Where a code file holds
  content text, such as the field guides' text in _system/pdf/, that text is
  content.

See LICENSE-CONTENT.md for the full map and NOTICE.md for what no licence here
covers (quotations, Google's documentation, press material, trademarks, fonts).

